<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 1.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 1.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 Villa World	     10.58   1.04</p>
<p> 2 Prime Credit Tr	 10.32   0.95</p>
<p> 3 McIntosh Sec	    10.00   0.90</p>
<p> 4 Prop Income Inv	  9.96   1.02</p>
<p> 5 BT Prop Trust	    9.60   1.70</p>
<p> 6 Indu Property	    9.58   0.95</p>
<p> 7 Colonial Mutual	  9.28   1.14</p>
<p> 8 MT Leyshon Gold	  9.26   2.70</p>
<p> 9 Aust Tour		  9.15   0.82</p>
<p>10 Central Equity	   9.00   1.00</p>
<p>11 Armstrong Retail	 8.92   0.74</p>
<p>12 Centro Prop		8.67   2.25</p>
<p>13 Equitilink		 8.62   0.58</p>
<p>14 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.57   0.91</p>
<p>15 Gen Prop Tr		8.48   2.37</p>
<p>16 Advance Pro CB	   8.47   1.37</p>
<p>17 Barclays Mirvac	  8.21   1.34</p>
<p>18 Natl In Prop	     8.20   1.02</p>
<p>19 Westfield Trust	  8.19   2.37</p>
<p>20 Westpac Prop Tr	  8.15   1.62</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
